# CODEOWNERS - millboard.com WordPress theme
#
# Owners are notified and requested as reviewers on any merge request that
# touches a matching path. See docs/code-ownership-and-branch-protection.md
# for the review tiers, the approval route, and what is enforced vs advisory.
#
# NOTE ON ENFORCEMENT: code owner *approval* is a GitLab Premium feature.
# On GitLab Free this file is advisory: GitLab shows the owners on the merge
# request and suggests them as reviewers, but does not block the merge.
# The enforced controls on Free are protected branches, "pipelines must
# succeed", and "all threads resolved". The accountability control for
# medium and high risk work is the Freshdesk change request and CAB.
#
# Last reviewed: 2026-08-03

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owner: everything in the repository
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                                       @aarondavismillboard

